828740/extras/05ae75fd259d16ddbe834db89a9bd49f.mp4?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDisruptor Phase\u200b</strong>\u200b - After [Auction], the lowest-scoring player per team becomes a [Disruptor]. Disruptors may attack but cannot collect treasures/objects.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/ca03c26a5b6d214350a623e458e2d1de.poster.avif?t=1752807864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/ca03c26a5b6d214350a623e458e2d1de.webm?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/ca03c26a5b6d214350a623e458e2d1de.mp4?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bFree-for-All Phase\u200b</strong>\u200b - After the [Super Treasure] appears, all players may both attack others and collect items.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c9a76e5e032699b55bdb91cf62358adc.poster.avif?t=1752807864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c9a76e5e032699b55bdb91cf62358adc.webm?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/c9a76e5e032699b55bdb91cf62358adc.mp4?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scenes contain numerous mechanisms: Some cause instant death, while others double treasure value. Learning mechanism mechanics is essential.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/4acac9ec28429385e3ab2bf971c67951.poster.avif?t=1752807864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/4acac9ec28429385e3ab2bf971c67951.webm?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/4acac9ec28429385e3ab2bf971c67951.mp4?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon death, players are teleported to [Labor Camp]. Completing labor tasks grants team-wide Buffs.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/6218f58cf1c351b6dfcc7f90c04e7c90.poster.avif?t=1752807864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/6218f58cf1c351b6dfcc7f90c04e7c90.webm?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/6218f58cf1c351b6dfcc7f90c04e7c90.mp4?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab your friends and blast off for this epic party!</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/4b4d053cd53c0c68d20863f811cc8568.poster.avif?t=1752807864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/4b4d053cd53c0c68d20863f811cc8568.webm?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828740/extras/4b4d053cd53c0c68d20863f811cc8568.mp4?t=1752807864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","developers":["Hermes Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"he